BT 1 0 0 1 0 9.6 Tm 8 TL .960784 .972549 .988235 rg /F3+0 6.4 Tf 8 TL (21. Agent vs workflow?) Tj  T* .666667 .721569 .8 rg (A workflow follows predefined steps; an agent can choose among actions based on state/model decisions, but reliable systems still bound tools and steps.) Tj T* ET
