BT 1 0 0 1 0 9.6 Tm 8 TL .960784 .972549 .988235 rg /F3+0 6.4 Tf 8 TL (24. Why use request timeouts?) Tj  T* .666667 .721569 .8 rg (Provider/network failures otherwise keep resources occupied and increase tail latency.) Tj T* ET
